    %% Control Plane Internals
    CPManagement -->|Manage| Assets
    CPManagement -->|Define| Policies
    Assets -->|Register| CPLogic
    Policies -->|Enforce| CPLogic
    CPDSP -->|Protocol| CPLogic
    CPPublic -->|Query| CPLogic
    
    %% Data Plane Internals
    DPControl -->|Transfer Control| DPLogic
    DPProxy -->|Data Stream| DPLogic
    
    %% Control to Data Plane
    CPLogic -->|Transfer Request| DPControl
    
    %% Data Sources
    DPLogic -->|Pull Data| Dashboard
    DPLogic -->|Pull Data| Sharepoint
    DPLogic -->|Pull Data| PartnerData
    
    %% Storage Connections
    CPLogic -.->|Persist State| Postgres
    CPLogic -.->|Secrets| Vault
    DPLogic -.->|Token Signing| Vault
    
    %% Configuration
    ConfigEnv -.->|Configure| CPLogic
    ConfigEnv -.->|Configure| DPLogic
    CustomCA -.->|Trust| CPLogic
    
    %% External Connections
    CPDSP -.->|Receive Requests :8084| IKLN
    CPLogic -.->|Verify DIDs| Portal
    CPLogic -.->|BPN→DID| Portal
    CPLogic -.->|Verify Credentials| Portal
    
